---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import '../styles/doc.css';
---
<Base title="VPNs You Pay for With Bitcoin - OpenBitcoin" description="Five VPNs that accept bitcoin, compared: how each takes payment, email required or not, pricing, jurisdiction, and audit history.">
<main class="wrap doc-wrap">
  <div class="doc-head">
    <div class="doc-kicker">VPN</div>
    <h1>VPNs that accept bitcoin</h1>
    
    
    <svg class="vp-hero" viewBox="0 0 92 100" aria-hidden="true">
      <g fill="none" stroke="#F7931A" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
        <path stroke-width="3" d="M46 4 78 16v26.2c0 18.1-12.9 32.2-32 37.3-19.1-5.1-32-19.2-32-37.3V16z" fill="rgba(247,147,26,.07)"/>
        <path stroke-width="2" stroke="rgba(247,147,26,.38)" d="M46 13.5 69.5 22.3v19.9c0 13.4-9.5 23.9-23.5 27.9-14-4-23.5-14.5-23.5-27.9V22.3z"/>
        <path stroke-width="4" d="M33 45l9.5 9.5L63 32.5"/>
      </g>
    </svg>
    <p class="doc-lede">Every provider below accepts bitcoin, so a subscription never has to touch a card or a bank. The <a href="/learn/privacy">privacy guide</a> covers where a VPN fits in.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="doc-grid">
  <div>
    <div class="vp-card">
      <div class="vp-tlab">Five providers that accept bitcoin</div>
      <p class="vp-intro">The <b>Method</b> column is the one that matters: Mullvad and IVPN issue a random account number and never ask for an email, so a subscription paid in bitcoin carries no identity at all. The rest is context: jurisdiction, monthly price, and any no-logs claims.</p>
      <div class="vp-scroll">
      <table class="vp-table" aria-label="VPN providers that accept bitcoin, compared">
        <thead>
          <tr><th>Provider</th><th>Method</th><th>Price</th><th>Jurisdiction</th><th>Notes</th><th></th></tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr>
            <td class="vp-prov"><span class="vp-pwrap"><a class="vp-logo vp-limg" href="https://mullvad.net" target="_blank" rel="noopener nofollow" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/img/vpn/mullvad.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"></a><span class="vp-pname"><b><a href="https://mullvad.net" rel="noopener nofollow" target="_blank">Mullvad</a></b></span></span></td>
            <td>Numbered account, no email</td>
            <td>&#8364;5</td>
            <td>Sweden</td>
            <td class="vp-notes">Independent audits; one price at every term length</td>
            <td class="vp-act"><a class="vp-visit" href="https://mullvad.net" rel="noopener nofollow" target="_blank">Get &#8599;</a></td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td class="vp-prov"><span class="vp-pwrap"><a class="vp-logo vp-limg" href="https://ivpn.net" target="_blank" rel="noopener nofollow" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/img/vpn/ivpn.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"></a><span class="vp-pname"><b><a href="https://ivpn.net" rel="noopener nofollow" target="_blank">IVPN</a></b></span></span></td>
            <td>Numbered account, no email</td>
            <td>$6</td>
            <td>Gibraltar</td>
            <td class="vp-notes">Annual independent audits; open-source apps</td>
            <td class="vp-act"><a class="vp-visit" href="https://ivpn.net" rel="noopener nofollow" target="_blank">Get &#8599;</a></td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td class="vp-prov"><span class="vp-pwrap"><a class="vp-logo vp-limg" href="https://nordvpn.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener nofollow" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/img/vpn/nordvpn.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"></a><span class="vp-pname"><b><a href="https://nordvpn.com" rel="noopener nofollow" target="_blank">NordVPN</a></b></span></span></td>
            <td>Email account</td>
            <td>$15</td>
            <td>Panama</td>
            <td class="vp-notes">Commissioned no-logs audits</td>
            <td class="vp-act"><a class="vp-visit" href="https://nordvpn.com" rel="noopener nofollow" target="_blank">Get &#8599;</a></td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td class="vp-prov"><span class="vp-pwrap"><a class="vp-logo vp-limg" href="https://protonvpn.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener nofollow" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/img/vpn/protonvpn.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"></a><span class="vp-pname"><b><a href="https://protonvpn.com" rel="noopener nofollow" target="_blank">Proton VPN</a></b></span></span></td>
            <td>Email account</td>
            <td>$10</td>
            <td>Switzerland</td>
            <td class="vp-notes">Open-source apps; published audits; free tier exists</td>
            <td class="vp-act"><a class="vp-visit" href="https://protonvpn.com" rel="noopener nofollow" target="_blank">Get &#8599;</a></td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td class="vp-prov"><span class="vp-pwrap"><a class="vp-logo vp-limg" href="https://expressvpn.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener nofollow" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/img/vpn/expressvpn.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"></a><span class="vp-pname"><b><a href="https://expressvpn.com" rel="noopener nofollow" target="_blank">ExpressVPN</a></b></span></span></td>
            <td>Email account</td>
            <td>$13</td>
            <td>British Virgin Islands</td>
            <td class="vp-notes">Commissioned no-logs and security audits</td>
            <td class="vp-act"><a class="vp-visit" href="https://expressvpn.com" rel="noopener nofollow" target="_blank">Get &#8599;</a></td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
      </div>
      <p class="vp-fine">Prices are the monthly rates as checked in August 2026 and change often; audit status and jurisdictions are as published by each provider.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="vp-card vp-mt">
      <div class="vp-tlab">What a VPN does for a bitcoin user</div>
      <p class="vp-p">A VPN moves your internet traffic through the provider's server, so the sites and servers you reach see the VPN's IP address instead of your home connection, and your internet provider sees only that you connected to a VPN. For a bitcoin user that matters in one specific place: your wallet is not a sealed box. It talks to servers, whether a public Electrum server, a block explorer, or one of the network's <a href="/nodes">reachable nodes</a>, and whoever runs that server can log the IP address asking about your addresses.</p>
      <div class="vp-cols">
        <div class="vp-col">
          <div class="vp-clab vp-clab-yes">What it changes</div>
          <ul class="vp-clist">
            <li>Hides your home IP from websites, network observers, and public Wi-Fi.</li>
            <li>Your wallet's server connections show the VPN's IP, not the one registered to your house.</li>
            <li>Your internet provider no longer sees which bitcoin services you touch.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="vp-col">
          <div class="vp-clab vp-clab-no">What it does not change</div>
          <ul class="vp-clist">
            <li>Nothing on-chain. Addresses and transactions are public forever regardless of how you connected; the <a href="/learn/privacy">privacy guide</a> covers that side.</li>
            <li>An exchange that verified your identity still knows exactly which withdrawals are yours.</li>
            <li>Trust does not disappear, it moves: from your internet provider to the VPN operator. That is why the criteria below exist.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="vp-choose">
        <div class="vp-tlab">Choosing criteria</div>
        <ul class="vp-crit">
          <li><b>No-logs claims backed by published audits.</b> Anyone can write "no logs" on a landing page; an independent audit with a public report is the only version that costs something to fake.</li>
          <li><b>An anonymous account model.</b> Two providers above issue a random account number instead of taking an email. No inbox, no password reset, nothing to subpoena a name from.</li>
          <li><b>Bitcoin payment closes the billing-identity loop.</b> A no-logs VPN paid by credit card still has your name in its billing records. Paid in bitcoin, on an account that is only a number, the subscription carries no identity at all.</li>
          <li><b>Open-source clients</b> let outsiders check that the app does what the marketing says.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="vp-about doc-prose">
      <p>A VPN is one layer of network privacy, not an anonymity system, and it does nothing to the public ledger itself; how on-chain privacy actually works is covered in the <a href="/learn/privacy">bitcoin privacy guide</a>, and buying coins without attaching your identity in the first place is covered in <a href="/learn/no-kyc">no-KYC bitcoin</a>. The servers a wallet leans on are visible on the <a href="/nodes">node map</a>, and running your own removes that dependency entirely. Affiliate relationships on this page, once live, are labeled where they appear and documented in the <a href="/disclosure">disclosure</a>; everything here is informational, not advice, per the <a href="/terms">terms</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <aside class="doc-rail">
    <div class="doc-tile">
      <div class="doc-tlab">Choosing criteria</div>
      <ul class="vp-rl">
        <li>No-logs claim with a published independent audit</li>
        <li>Account number instead of an email address</li>
        <li>Takes bitcoin, so billing carries no identity</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="doc-tile">
      <div class="doc-tlab">Related</div>
      <nav>
        <a href="/learn/privacy">Bitcoin privacy guide</a>
        <a href="/nodes">Reachable nodes</a>
        <a href="/disclosure">Affiliate disclosure</a>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </aside>
  </div>
</main>
<style is:global>
  
  
  .vp-hero{float:right;width:92px;height:auto;margin:-28px 12px 0 26px;
    filter:drop-shadow(0 10px 26px rgba(247,147,26,.16));animation:vpfloat 6s ease-in-out infinite}
  @keyframes vpfloat{0%,100%{transform:translateY(0)}50%{transform:translateY(-6px)}}
  @media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.vp-hero{animation:none}}
  @media(max-width:640px){.vp-hero{width:88px;margin:2px 0 6px 14px}}
  .vp-card{background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;padding:22px 24px}
  .vp-mt{margin-top:14px}
  .vp-tlab{font:700 9.5px var(--mono);letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--ink-3);margin-bottom:10px}
  
  .vp-intro{font:500 13.5px/1.65 var(--sans);color:var(--ink-2);margin:0 0 16px}
  .vp-intro b{color:var(--ink);font-weight:600}
  .vp-scroll{overflow-x:auto}
  .vp-table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse}
  .vp-table th{font:700 9.5px var(--mono);letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--ink-3);
    text-align:left;padding:0 14px 8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line-2);white-space:nowrap}
  .vp-table td{font:500 13px/1.5 var(--sans);color:var(--ink-2);padding:11px 14px 11px 0;
    border-bottom:1px dotted var(--line-2);vertical-align:top}
  .vp-table tr:last-child td{border-bottom:0}
  
  .vp-prov b{display:block;font:700 14px var(--sans);color:var(--ink)}
  .vp-prov b a{color:var(--ink);text-decoration:none;border-bottom:1px dashed rgba(247,147,26,.35);padding-bottom:1px}
  .vp-prov b a:hover{color:var(--acc);border-bottom-style:solid}
  
  .vp-logo{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:28px;height:28px;flex:none;
    border:1px solid var(--line-2);border-radius:8px;background:var(--field);overflow:hidden;
    font:700 13px var(--mono);color:var(--ink-2);text-decoration:none}
  a.vp-logo:hover{border-color:rgba(255,166,60,.6)}
  .vp-limg img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:contain;padding:3px;border-radius:inherit;display:block;box-sizing:border-box}
  
  .vp-prov{vertical-align:top}
  .vp-prov .vp-pwrap{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px}
  .vp-pname{min-width:0}
  .vp-table td{padding-right:10px}
  .vp-table th{padding-right:10px}
  
  .vp-notes{min-width:132px}
  .vp-act{text-align:right}
  
  .vp-visit{display:inline-block;font:700 13.5px var(--mono);letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;
    background:#F7931A;color:#101A2C;border:1.5px solid #F7931A;border-radius:9px;
    padding:11px 20px;text-decoration:none;white-space:nowrap;
    box-shadow:0 4px 14px rgba(247,147,26,.22),inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.18)}
  .vp-visit:hover{background:#FFA63C;border-color:#FFA63C}
  .vp-fine{font:500 11.5px/1.5 var(--sans);color:var(--ink-3);margin:12px 0 0}
  .vp-p{font:500 14px/1.65 var(--sans);color:var(--ink-2);margin:0}
  .vp-p a{color:var(--acc);text-decoration:none;border-bottom:1px dashed rgba(247,147,26,.35);padding-bottom:1px}
  .vp-p a:hover{border-bottom-style:solid}
  .vp-cols{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px;margin-top:14px}
  .vp-col{background:var(--field);border:1px solid var(--line-2);border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px}
  .vp-clab{font:700 9.5px var(--mono);letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:8px;
    display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px}
  .vp-clab::before{content:"";width:9px;height:9px;border-radius:2px}
  .vp-clab-yes{color:var(--up)}
  .vp-clab-yes::before{background:var(--up)}
  .vp-clab-no{color:var(--down)}
  .vp-clab-no::before{background:var(--down)}
  .vp-clist{margin:0;padding-left:18px}
  .vp-clist li{font:500 13px/1.6 var(--sans);color:var(--ink-2);margin-top:6px}
  .vp-clist li::marker{color:var(--ink-3)}
  .vp-clist a{color:var(--acc);text-decoration:none;border-bottom:1px dashed rgba(247,147,26,.35);padding-bottom:1px}
  .vp-clist a:hover{border-bottom-style:solid}
  .vp-choose{margin-top:16px;padding-top:16px;border-top:1px dotted var(--line-2)}
  .vp-crit{margin:0;padding-left:22px}
  .vp-crit li{font:500 14px/1.65 var(--sans);color:var(--ink-2);margin-top:8px}
  .vp-crit li::marker{color:var(--acc);font-weight:700}
  .vp-crit b{color:var(--ink);font-weight:600}
  .vp-about{margin-top:14px}
  .vp-about p{font:500 13.5px/1.65 var(--sans);color:var(--ink-3)}
  .vp-rl{margin:0;padding-left:16px}
  .vp-rl li{font:600 11.5px/1.5 var(--sans);color:var(--ink-2);margin-top:6px}
  .vp-rl li:first-child{margin-top:0}
  .vp-rl li::marker{color:var(--acc)}
  
  @media(max-width:1150px){
    .vp-cols{grid-template-columns:1fr}
    .vp-card{padding:18px 16px}
    
    .vp-scroll{overflow:visible}
    .vp-table{min-width:0;table-layout:auto}
    .vp-table thead{display:none}
    .vp-table,.vp-table tbody,.vp-table tr,.vp-table td{display:block;width:auto}
    .vp-table tr{position:relative;padding:14px 0 13px;border-bottom:1px dotted var(--line-2)}
    .vp-table tr:last-child{padding-bottom:4px;border-bottom:0}
    .vp-table td{border-bottom:0;padding:0;font-size:13px}
    .vp-prov{padding-right:84px;white-space:normal}
    
    .vp-table td:nth-child(2),.vp-table td:nth-child(3),
    .vp-table td:nth-child(4){margin-top:8px;color:var(--ink-2)}
    .vp-table td:nth-child(2)::before{content:"Method: "}
    .vp-table td:nth-child(3)::before{content:"Price: "}
    .vp-table td:nth-child(4)::before{content:"Jurisdiction: "}
    .vp-table td:nth-child(2)::before,.vp-table td:nth-child(3)::before,
    .vp-table td:nth-child(4)::before{
      font:600 9.5px var(--mono);letter-spacing:.09em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--ink-3)}
    .vp-notes{margin-top:8px;min-width:0;font-size:13px;color:var(--ink-2)}
    .vp-act{position:absolute;top:12px;right:0;text-align:right}
    .vp-visit{font-size:11.5px;padding:9px 13px}
  }
</style>
</Base>
